      "rationale": {
        "summary": "Single profile: nearest threat is the champion Gaper (831266187:2) 126 px below at 20 HP, so at 3.5 damage it needs ~6 hits and is targeted first while holding 90-146 px (0.45-0.75 of 195 effective range). Retreating straight up is not available: the player sits at y=160 with the room border near y=140 and a rock line at y=200 (grids 72/73/76/79), so positioning is lateral strafe toward the open top-right lane (grids 75/78/80/81/82) rather than vertical kite, avoiding the type 16 cells at grid 20/27 corner and rock-adjacent blind spots. Predictive aim with movement inheritance suits a steadily advancing walker. Evade prefers max clearance because contact damage is the only confirmed danger and there are no enemy projectiles on the field. Type 94 enemies and the champion variant effect are unverified, so no mechanic-specific behavior is assumed; only contact collision (class 4) is treated as dangerous, and Gaper death may spawn a Pacer/Gusher successor that triggers replan on new_enemy_mechanism.",
